// Creature of Fenkenstrain.
//
// As with The Lost Tribe the stage numbers are fixed by the cache, not chosen. Four multinpcs and
// one multiloc switch on %fenk_quest, and between them they say where the quest starts and ends:
//
//   [fenk_fenkenstrain]            multinpc 0..7 -> fenk_fenkenstrain_model
//   [fenk_fenkenstrain_in_tower]   multinpc 8    -> fenk_fenkenstrain_model
//   [fenk_creature]                multinpc 0..7 -> fenk_creature_model     ("Fenkenstrain's Monster")
//   [fenk_creature_released]       multinpc 8    -> fenk_creature_model_2   ("Lord Rologarth")
//   [fenk_table_multi]             multiloc 3    -> fenk_table_corpse, every other value a bare table
//
// So 8 is the end of it: at 8 and only at 8 the doctor is the one standing in the tower, and the
// thing on the slab has a name. And 3 is the one stage where a body is lying assembled on the
// table - which is what sewing it together has to set.
//
// The two shells are placed a few tiles apart in m55_55 (fenk_fenkenstrain at 31,30 and
// fenk_fenkenstrain_in_tower at 29,35; fenk_creature at 27,35 and fenk_creature_released at
// 32,30), so the swap at stage 8 moves both of them as well as changing who they are. Nothing in
// script has to place or despawn anything.
^fenk_not_started = 0
^fenk_started = 1
^fenk_parts_gathered = 2
^fenk_body_sewn = 3
^fenk_conductor_fitted = 4
^fenk_creature_alive = 5
^fenk_creature_spoke = 6
^fenk_has_proof = 7

// The four body parts, the three locks, the coffin, the clock and the conductor are all varbits
// the cache already declares on fenk_flags (%fenk_arms, %fenk_legs, %fenk_torso, %fenk_head,
// %fenk_unlocked_tower/_cavern/_shed, %fenk_coffin, %fenk_wound_clock, %fenk_conductor_repaired,
// %fenk_read_signpost), so none of them is redeclared here as a bit number.

// The brush reaches the shed key once it is fenk_brush3, three canes on. That is the obj chain
// itself (fenk_brush0..3), so there is no separate count to declare - and no coord constant for
// the conductor either, since it is reached through its own [oploc1,fenk_conductor_broken].
